      <header class="page-header">
        <h1>Dead Hangs and Longevity: Why Grip Strength Predicts How Long You Live</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Stronger grip is associated with lower mortality risk in large cohort studies. No trial shows that hanging lengthens life, and Peter Attia's dead hang targets are aimed at very strong people.</p>
      </header>
    </div>
    <article class="article">
      <div class="article-meta">
        <a href="/about/" class="author-link">
          <span class="author-avatar">DH</span>
          <span>DeadHangs Team</span>
        </a>
        <span class="meta-sep">·</span>
